4. Data
-------

TuringOne Community Edition is primarily self-hosted and application data
remains in your own infrastructure.

During initial Community registration, limited account information may be
transmitted to TuringOne for Community Edition registration and service
management purposes.

Where you configure external services, including large language model
providers, information sent to those services is governed by the respective
provider's terms and privacy policies. 

Where you configure an external service — such as a large language model 
provider — data you send to that service is governed by that provider's own terms.


